airbanks.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fairbanks-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fairbanks.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lcard-b"><h2>Fairbanks</h2><p>Fairbanks North Star Borough · Interior</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/communities-served/juneau-insurance-appraiser/"><span class="lcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/juneau.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/juneau-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/juneau.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="710" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lcard-b"><h2>Juneau</h2><p>City and Borough of Juneau · Southeast</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/communities-served/ketchikan-insurance-appraiser/"><span class="lcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ketchikan.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ketchikan-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ketchikan.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="813" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lcard-b"><h2>Ketchikan</h2><p>Ketchikan Gateway Borough · Southeast</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/communities-served/sitka-insurance-appraiser/"><span class="lcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/sitka.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/sitka-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/sitka.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="756" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lcard-b"><h2>Sitka</h2><p>City and Borough of Sitka · Southeast</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/communities-served/kenai-soldotna-insurance-appraiser/"><span class="lcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kenai-soldotna.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kenai-soldotna-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kenai-soldotna.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="802" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lcard-b"><h2>Kenai &amp; Soldotna</h2><p>Kenai Peninsula Borough · Kenai Peninsula</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/communities-served/homer-insurance-appraiser/"><span class="lcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/homer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/homer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/homer.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lcard-b"><h2>Homer</h2><p>Kenai Peninsula Borough · Kenai Peninsula</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/communities-served/kodiak-insurance-appraiser/"><span class="lcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/kodiak.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/kodiak-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/kodiak.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lcard-b"><h2>Kodiak</h2><p>Kodiak Island Borough · Kodiak &amp; Gulf Coast</p></span></a><a class="lcard rv" href="/communities-served/valdez-insurance-appraiser/"><span class="lcard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/valdez.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/valdez-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/valdez.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="750" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="lcard-b"><h2>Valdez</h2><p>Chugach Census Area · Prince William Sound</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head left rv"><p class="kicker dark">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across Alaska</h2><p>The same policy language plays out very differently in a Fairbanks log home, a Juneau hillside house and a Mat-Su shop.</p></div><div class="regions"><article class="region rv"><div class="region-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/anchorage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/anchorage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/anchorage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:800px) 100vw, 40vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Southcentral &amp; Mat-Su</h3><p class="region-sub">Anchorage · Eagle River · Wasilla · Palmer</p><ul class="chips"><li>Earthquake (with coverage)</li><li>Downslope &amp; Matanuska winds</li><li>Snow load</li><li>Wildfire</li></ul><p>Most of the state’s population and most of its claims. The 2018 earthquake, Hillside and Matanuska windstorms and heavy-snow winters all show up here.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:800px) 100vw, 40vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Interior</h3><p class="region-sub">Fairbanks · North Pole · Delta Junction</p><ul class="chips"><li>Forty-below freeze-ups</li><li>Rain on snow</li><li>Wildfire smoke</li><li>Chimney fires</li></ul><p>Extreme cold turns a heating failure into a whole-house water loss. Summers bring wildfire smoke across the Tanana Valley.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/juneau.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/juneau-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/juneau.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:800px) 100vw, 40vw" width="1200" height="710" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Southeast</h3><p class="region-sub">Juneau · Ketchikan · Sitka</p><ul class="chips"><li>Heavy rain</li><li>Taku &amp; Gulf winds</li><li>Glacial outburst floods</li><li>Landslides</li></ul><p>Steep, wet and barge-supplied. Water intrusion, wind and difficult access drive the cost of nearly every repair.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/homer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/homer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/homer.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:800px) 100vw, 40vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Kenai Peninsula &amp; Kodiak</h3><p class="region-sub">Kenai · Soldotna · Homer · Kodiak</p><ul class="chips"><li>Wildfire</li><li>Coastal wind</li><li>Volcanic ash</li><li>Earthquake (with coverage)</li></ul><p>Beetle-killed spruce, coastal storms and Cook Inlet volcanoes. Island and end-of-road locations raise repair costs.</p></div></article><article class="region rv"><div class="region-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-response.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-response-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-response.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:800px) 100vw, 40vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="region-b"><h3>Western &amp; Arctic</h3><p class="region-sub">Bethel · Nome · Utqiagvik · villages</p><ul class="chips"><li>Ex-typhoon storms</li><li>Extreme cold</li><li>Fire</li><li>Remote logistics</li></ul><p>Off the road system, freight and travel can rival the repair itself. Flood and erosion are usually excluded; wind, fire and interior water are not.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><p class="cta-h">Don’t see your community?</p><p>We work statewide. Call and tell us where the property is, including fly-in and barge-served locations.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line light" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
